Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Uninstall — removes the uBlock Origin force-install policy for Yandex Browser.
; Double-click (elevated), then restart the browser; it drops the extension.
; Deletes only uBO's entry, so any other ExtensionSettings policies stay intact.
; Does NOT undo the managed-device step — run fake-mdm-undo.reg for that (if nothing
; else needs it), or remove the browser from Chrome Enterprise Core.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\YandexBrowser\ExtensionSettings]
"cbmpaamhmhdhnkofemgdlnbdadbpmjkn"=-

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\YandexBrowser]
"DeveloperToolsAvailability"=-
